load)", "tickChannel" => "enemy_dt"}, %{"note" => "Missiles AFTER the swarm: homing missiles read the swarm's just-updated positions to retarget, so the swarm must have moved first this frame.", "order" => "7", "system" => "missiles (_update_missiles)", "tickChannel" => "physics_dt"}, %{"note" => "Bosses AFTER missiles: a boss can be hit by a missile resolved this frame and react (phase change, retaliation) within the same frame, so it updates after missile motion/impact resolution.", "order" => "8", "system" => "bosses (_update_bosses)", "tickChannel" => "physics_dt"}, %{"note" => "XP / score crystals shimmer and drift on visual timing, independent of sim speed — real dt keeps them lively during a freeze.", "order" => "9", "system" => "crystals (_update_crystals)", "tickChannel" => "real_dt"}, %{"note" => "Pooled VFX lifetimes (shockwave / wind-slash) are pure visual and run on real dt. Explosions flush LAST, after every other subsystem mutated state — that ordering makes chain-explosion multipliers deterministic within the frame.", "order" => "10", "system" => "effects (_update_effects) + explosions flush (_flush_batched_explosions)", "tickChannel" => "real_dt"}, %{"note" => "A pure display pass AFTER the sim resolved this frame: reads the just-settled player/stat/spree state, ages the feed + floating damage numbers on real dt (UI timing is wall-clock, not sim-scaled). Order-last so the HUD shows this frame's resolved state.", "order" => "11", "system" => "hud (_update_hud)", "tickChannel" => "real_dt"}], "title" => "Coordinator per-frame loop"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:41.482297Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:41.482297Z], "03a8aa5b-b5ce-438d-b9f2-06349cd6c17b"]
