 (both missiles and lasers check distToPlayer < 1.5).", "name" => "hitRadius", "title" => "Hit radius (units)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "Damage dealt to the player on hit/detonation. projectile_types.gd MISSILE_DAMAGE 80.0 / LASER_DAMAGE 80.0. Thrown grenade is player-side (GRENADE_DETONATE_DAMAGE 450.0 to enemies).", "name" => "damage", "title" => "Damage to player", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "True if the player can shoot the projectile down. Missiles carry MISSILE_BASE_HP (60) + a fat collision sphere; lasers cannot be destroyed.", "name" => "destroyable", "title" => "Destroyable (shootable)", "type" => "boolean"}, %{"description" => "The visual effect this projectile renders with (tint / trail / halo).", "name" => "vfx", "refType" => "vfx", "title" => "VFX", "type" => "reference"}], false, "document", [], "5c1e623e-865d-481e-bb7f-1264b25aa6a0", "e16c05fc-b360-43f2-9609-01c5f240f66a", "production", [], "send", [], "69116f3e-4de6-429c-8362-b5e6ec8e1977", "private", [], [], %{"kind" => "homing"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:41.521073Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:41.521073Z], "09caaf29-2f8d-4504-bdda-314002464165"]
