r / low-to-high. Each carries the ring node's world-y. Source nagrand_arena.gd RimRings (Ring0/1/2 node transforms in nagrand_arena.tscn).", "name" => "rimRings", "of" => %{"fields" => [%{"description" => "World-y position of this rim ring's node. Source nagrand_arena.tscn RimRings/Ring* transforms (-1.25 / 4.75 / 13.45).", "name" => "y", "title" => "Ring y (m)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}], "type" => "composite"}, "ordered" => true, "title" => "Rim rings", "type" => "arrayOf"}, %{"description" => "Number of emissive corner pillars (the Algiz-rune monolith companions) placed for scale. Source nagrand_arena.gd Pillars (Pillar0..Pillar3, four corners at ±30 XZ).", "name" => "pillars", "title" => "Pillar count", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "The single shadowed DirectionalLight3D 'Sun' that lights the disc (Mobile-renderer budget: one shadow caster). Fill / ambient / fog / bloom live in the Environment resource, not here. Source nagrand_arena.gd Sun (nagrand_arena.tscn).", "fields" => [%{"description" => "Dusk sun yaw the Sun DirectionalLight3D points from — a near-horizontal dusk rake (the shipped game pins dayTime ~0.95 in the Dusk->Night band). Derived from the Sun basis in nagrand_arena.tscn (~-51.4 deg).", "name" => "sunAngle", "title" => "Sun angle (deg)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "light_energy of the Sun DirectionalLight3D — dim because dusk. Source nagrand_arena.tscn Sun.light_energy (0.5).", "name" => "energy", "title" => "Sun energy", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}], "name" => "lighting", "title" => "Lighting", "type" => "composite"}], false, "document", [], "production", [], "home", [], "private", [], [], %{"lighting" => %{"energy" => "0.5", "sunAngle" => "-51.4"}, "pillars" => "4", "radius" => "175", "rimRings" => [%{"y" => "-1.25"}, %{"y" => "4.75"}, %{"y" => "13.45"}], "spawnRing" => %{"max" => "110", "min" => "60"}, "title" => "Nagrand Arena"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:41.612446Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:41.612446Z], "81fcceb4-5868-4717-85a2-757f57a3df25"]
