, eg shrink-wrapped trade pack, filled dumpbin, filled counterpack", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.065769Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.065769Z], "7932be0d-c65a-4499-bb63-39302f0527a4", "e56043b7-b88a-4ca5-8f5c-d0358767fff6", "Multiple-item pack", "Carrying multiple components, primarily for retailing as separate items. The pack may be split and retailed as separate items OR retailed as a single item. Use instead of Multiple-item trade-only pack (code 30) if the data provider specifically wishes to make explicit that the pack may optionally be retailed as a whole", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.065769Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.065769Z], "71f5295d-3b5b-4cea-96e4-3763009c23bc"]
