which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], "f675ee5d-7c52-4f45-9161-e18ffc6ec05a", "6e91a828-55a9-46f5-81a9-9652f5f320d2", "Thickness", "For a book, the overall thickness of the spine. For a folded map, the thickness when folded. For packaged products, the depth of the retail packaging, and for trade-only products, the depth of the trade packaging. In general, the thickness or depth of a product in the form in which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], "8fd91b4c-2a0d-4074-8af6-20d1f92e4ff7", "a87b9819-dd33-4289-af2c-dc30e21ae4bd", "Page trim height", "Overall height (code 01) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], "fca63c0b-6385-4f51-becb-eb57525b806f", "e919a394-fb02-469a-a151-e16b014ad03d", "Page trim width", "Overall width (code 02) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang and spine thickness for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], "226f16dd-ece5-450e-bfb7-6e1a93faef17", "d551972a-da41-41d5-8713-1d6b6915451d", "Unit volume", "The volume of the product, including any retail packaging. Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], "e2300481-39e9-4461-973b-a4e62687f0af", "7fa47cfe-3a39-47a3-b7ea-e54862e852de", "Unit capacity", "Volume of the internal (fluid) contents of a product (eg of paint in a can). Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:36:42.302075Z], "430c9026-b702-4c89-a6a3-5ca6030c2162", "329e8e70-a189-4bb4-be01-ed35233f50dd", ...]
